Modified files (GPL-3.0 section 5a), changed 2026-11-01
--------------------------------------------------------
README.md                fork section added above the upstream README
main/ui.c, main/ui.h     Daylight UI: status bar, home page, soft keys,
                         popups and summary restyled, menu-open helper
main/datapage.c/.h       data cell layout, number fonts, route progress bar
main/mapview.c/.h        heading arrow, north marker, zoom buttons, scale
                         chip, route colours, course setter
main/theme.c/.h          Daylight / Night colour tokens and shared styles
main/layouts.c/.h        layouts 5C and M3, map strip row height
main/config.c            defaults: light theme, 5C ride page, M3 map strip
main/fields.c            "Session Time" shown as "Ride Time"
main/main.c              key 1 opens the menu on the home page
main/sdcard.h            mount point can be overridden (desktop renderer)
main/CMakeLists.txt      font sources added

Added files: docs/UI_DESIGN.md, docs/images/daylight_*.png, NOTICE,
CITATION.cff, main/fonts/*, assets/fonts/*, tools/gen_fonts.sh,
tools/fix_font.py, tools/uisim/*. The git history has the full details.


